<li><strong>Set and uphold quality standards.</strong> Lead creative reviews and take responsibility for the relevance, originality, consistency and execution of the work.</li>
<li><strong>Connect brand, experience and communication.</strong> Collaborate across strategy, design, content and technology so the brand promise carries through every touchpoint.</li>
<li><strong>Lead creative pitches and client conversations.</strong> Develop persuasive recommendations, present ideas clearly, handle feedback and build confidence in the work.</li>
