bottom:7pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Do you want to win international brands for Remazing, lead complex sales cycles, and actively shape our global commercial strategy? Then this role could be the perfect fit for you.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.345;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:7pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">As Senior Sales Manager, you will take ownership of strategic opportunities, high-stakes pitches, and long-term client relationships across multiple markets. The position also offers a path towards becoming Sales Lead for Remazing Core and taking on functional and people leadership for our Sales team, which currently consists of two team members.</span></p><span style="font-size:13pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Your tasks</span><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">GLOBAL NEW BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT: You will identify and develop strategically relevant business opportunities across our international markets and own the entire sales process, from targeted outreach and qualification to negotiation and contract signature. You will build a robust global pipeline and develop sustainable partnerships with relevant brands.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">STRATEGIC ACCOUNT &amp; STAKEHOLDER MANAGEMENT: You will manage complex opportunities involving multiple stakeholders, build relationships with senior decision-makers, and position Remazing as a strategic partner. You quickly understand business challenges and translate them into compelling, value-led solutions.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">PITCH OWNERSHIP &amp; NEGOTIATION: You will own international pitches and complex tenders, develop analysis-driven narratives together with internal teams, and lead negotiations confidently through to closing. You will ensure that our proposals are commercially compelling and tailored to the relevant brand, market, and need.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">COMMERCIAL STRATEGY &amp; MARKET DEVELOPMENT: You will analyse market and industry trends, identify new target segments, and translate them into concrete growth opportunities. You will actively contribute your insights to the development of our global commercial strategy, service portfolio, and go-to-market approaches.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">SALES OPERATIONS &amp; FORECASTING: You will manage your pipeline based on data, maintain accurate deal progression in HubSpot, and prepare reliable forecasts. You will challenge processes and metrics, define concrete actions, and create transparency around priorities, risks, and potential.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">INTERNATIONAL COLLABORATION: You will coordinate cross-market opportunities and work closely with our international hubs as well as Consulting, Marketing, and other specialist teams. You will create clear ownership, connect different perspectives, and ensure consistent communication with prospective clients.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">TEAM DEVELOPMENT &amp; MENTORING: You will share your expertise, support colleagues in challenging sales situations, and provide structured feedback. Even before taking on formal leadership, you will strengthen shared standards, improve ways of working, and support the team in its day-to-day business.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">LEADERSHIP PERSPECTIVE: You will have the opportunity to develop towards the Sales Lead role for Remazing Core. In this position, you will additionally take on functional and people leadership for the Sales team, which currently consists of two team members, set clear goals, further develop the team strategy, and share responsibility for the sustainable development of our sales performance.</span></p></p><br><strong>Your profile</strong><p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">B2B SALES EXPERIENCE: You bring at least 5 years of experience in consultative B2B sales, ideally in a digital environment such as digital marketing, e-commerce, marketplace services, an agency, or SaaS. You have a strong track record in complex international sales cycles and successful closing.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">LANGUAGE: You communicate, negotiate, and present confidently in English and German at C1 level or above.  Additional languages are a big plus! </span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">STRATEGIC &amp; COMMERCIAL MINDSET: You combine a strong understanding of markets with sound commercial judgement. You recognise potential, prioritise opportunities based on evidence, and turn client needs into sustainable business opportunities.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">GLOBAL SALES MINDSET: You operate confidently in an international environment, adapt to different markets and cultures, and manage complex processes across countries and teams.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">MARKETPLACE &amp; TECHNICAL EXPERTISE: You ideally bring experience in Amazon marketing, e-commerce, or data-driven services, or can quickly develop a strong understanding of complex topics. You communicate sophisticated services in a credible, clear, and client-centred way.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">NEGOTIATION &amp; CLOSING STRENGTH: You lead demanding negotiations with clarity, reliability, and a solution-oriented approach. You can align different interests, handle objections confidently, and move complex opportunities consistently towards closing.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">LEADERSHIP POTENTIAL: You enjoy supporting others, sharing knowledge, and providing clear direction. Initial experience in leadership, mentoring, or coaching is highly welcome; most importantly, you are motivated to take ownership and develop towards a formal people leadership role.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.295;margin-top:7pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#1d1c1d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">STRUCTURED &amp; DATA-DRIVEN APPROACH: You work independently, in a structured way, and with a strong focus on results. CRM discipline, reliable forecasting, and data-led prioritisation are integral to your approach to professional sales management.</span></p></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/remazing-gmbh/senior-sales-manager-global-markets-all-genders-hamburg-284626","tags":["B2B Sales","New Business Development","Lead Management","Amazon Marketing","CRM (Hub Spot)","E-Commerce","Pitch Preparation","Digital Marketing","Sales"],"job_types":["Experienced","Permanent","Full time"],"location":"Hamburg","created_at":1791480566},{"slug":"communications-managerin-content-campaigns-mit-schwerpunkt-antisemitismuskritische-bildungsarbeit-bei-germandream-teilzeit-berlin-141423","company_name":"HÁWAR.help & GermanDream","title":"Communications Manager:in | Content & Campaigns mit Schwerpunkt antisemitismuskritische Bildungsarbeit bei GermanDream (m/w/d · Teilzeit)","description":"<br><strong>Die Position</strong><p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size:15px;">BERLIN <span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size:15px;">· a</span></strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:15px;">b sofort · befristet bis 31.12.2027 </span></strong></span></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size:15px;">Teilzeit – 32 Std./Woche | <span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size:15px;">Besetzung vorbehaltlich der Mittelzusage</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size:15px;">Bewerbungsfrist: 30.09.2026, 13.00 Uhr </span></strong></span></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;"><br></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du möchtest gesellschaftlich relevante Themen verständlich, sensibel und zielgruppengerecht erzählen? Du hast ein Gespür für Social Media, Storytelling und politische Bildungsarbeit – und willst Inhalte und Kampagnen für ein antisemitismuskritisches Bildungsprojekt entwickeln, die junge Menschen erreichen? Dann werde Teil von GermanDream.</span></p><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;">Über uns</span><br><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">GermanDream ist Deutschlands präsenteste Bildungsbewegung für gelebte Demokratie und Teilhabe. Mit unseren Begegnungsformaten, Bildungsprogrammen sowie durch Vernetzungs- und Öffentlichkeitsarbeit vermitteln wir nachhaltig die Werte des Grundgesetzes – im Klassenzimmer, im Alltag und überall dort, wo Menschen zusammenkommen.</span></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Mit dem Projekt <strong>DECODED – Antisemitismus in Popkultur und Medien</strong> erweitern wir unsere antisemitismuskritische Bildungsarbeit in Berlin. Gemeinsam mit jüdischen Künstler:innen, Expert:innen und weiteren Kooperationspartner:innen machen wir antisemitische Codes, Sprachbilder und digitale Dynamiken sichtbar. Wir stärken Jugendliche, Lehrkräfte und pädagogische Fachkräfte darin, Antisemitismus zu erkennen, einzuordnen und ihm handlungssicher zu begegnen. Im Mittelpunkt stehen Workshops mit Jugendlichen, Qualifizierungen für Lehrkräfte, digitale Inhalte und weitere Formate.</span></p><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;">Deine Rolle</span><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;"><br></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du koordinierst und gestaltest die kommunikative Umsetzung des Projekts – von der Redaktions- und Contentplanung bis zur Veröffentlichung: Du schreibst Texte, gestaltest Grafiken, konzipierst Videoformate, begleitest Workshops, Drehs und Veranstaltungen, filmst selbst mit und schneidest kurze Videoformate.</span></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Dabei übersetzt du die fachlichen Themen des Projekts in verständliche, sensible und zielgruppengerechte Inhalte für Social Media, Website, Newsletter und weitere Kanäle – von Reels, Posts, Sharepics und Story-Formaten bis hin zu Website-Texten, Newsletter-Inhalten und begleitenden Kommunikationsmaterialien für Bildungsangebote und Veranstaltungen.</span></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du entwickelst Formate und Kampagnen in enger Abstimmung mit deiner direkten Führungskraft, dem Projektteam und den eingebundenen Fachrollen. Du bereitest Einblicke aus der Projektarbeit redaktionell und visuell auf und behältst dabei Redaktionspläne, Termine, Abstimmungen und benötigte Materialien im Blick.</span></p><p style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">So trägst du dazu bei, dass die Themen und Angebote des Projektes unterschiedliche Zielgruppen erreichen, jüdische Perspektiven respektvoll sichtbar werden und antisemitismuskritische Bildungsarbeit auch im digitalen Raum Wirkung entfalten kann.</span></p><br><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;">Was dich in dieser Rolle erwartet</span><br><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;">Content, Redaktion und Storytelling</span><br><ul style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;"><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du planst, erstellst und veröffentlichst Inhalte für die Projektkommunikation für Social Media, Website, Newsletter und unsere Öffentlichkeitsarbeit.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du bereitest komplexe fachliche Inhalte verständlich, niedrigschwellig und zielgruppengerecht auf.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du gestaltest Texte, Posts, Kurzvideos und weitere digitale Formate rund um die Themen und Aktivitäten des Projekts.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du erzählst Geschichten aus Workshops, Qualifizierungen, Kooperationen und Veranstaltungen und machst die Menschen und Perspektiven hinter dem Projekt sichtbar.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du achtest darauf, dass jüdische Perspektiven respektvoll, differenziert und diskriminierungssensibel dargestellt werden.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du passt Inhalte an die jeweiligen Kanäle, Zielgruppen und Plattformlogiken an.</li></ul><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px;">Kampagnen, Social Media und Medienproduktion</span><br><ul style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;"><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du entwickelst und realisierst Kommunikationsformate, Contenstrecken und Kampagnen im Rahmen des Projektes.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du betreust die projektbezogenen Inhalte auf den Social-Media-Kanälen von GermanDream und sorgst für eine verlässliche Veröffentlichung.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du planst und begleitest Veranstaltungen, Videodrehs, Interviews und Videoporträts, breitest Fragen und Abläufe vor und stimmst dich dazu mit allen Beteiligten ab.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du begleitest Workshops, Drehs und Veranstaltungen vor Ort, filmst selbst mit und sammelst geeignetes Foto-, Video- und O-Ton-Material.</li><li style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Du schneidest kurze Videoformate 