&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🇫🇷 350+ Mirakl Tech teams members mainly based in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚙️ 5 Saas Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science Intern - January 2027&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Data Science team, a group of around 70 data professionals working at the heart of Mirakl&#39;s platform. Together, you&#39;ll be making the most of rich and diverse marketplace data to grow customer revenue, optimize operations, and ensure the safety of users and transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze and prepare data&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure quality and relevance for algorithm development, following best practices for exploration and transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype and iterate on algorithms&lt;/strong&gt;, testing and refining ideas with the support of your mentor and team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Data Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to bring your solutions from experimentation to real-world production deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build dashboards&lt;/strong&gt; to showcase the relevance of your work and monitor performance in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Present your findings&lt;/strong&gt; weekly with the team, contributing to brainstorming sessions and tech watch initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in the final year of a Master&#39;s (Bac+5) in Computer Science at an engineering school or university&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data preparation techniques and feature engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of statistics, machine learning, and deep learning algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in the industrialization and scaling of data science models beyond experimental work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud environment awareness (AWS, Google Cloud, or MS Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and ability to work collaboratively in cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, autonomy, and a proactive approach to problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Python &amp;amp; its data science ecosystem (pandas,sklearn), SQL for data querying and manipulation, TensorFlow, Keras, PyTorch, Databricks, Spark, AWS (Amazon Redshift, S3), Airflow, Delta Lake, streamlit, pydantic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French – Fluent required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English – Professional level required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Compensation, Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internship stipend:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on your Master&#39;s status&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace that supports well-being and balance: breakfasts, fitness and yoga classes, after-work events, game nights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring from senior technical experts and regular feedback to support your growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immersion in a collaborative, international team passionate about sharing knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 remote work days per month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Works Council discounts (tickets, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gymlib pass for your well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern offices in the heart of Paris (near the Eiffel Tower)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Swile meal vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transportation covered (50% Navigo, bike, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application — this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manual screening of your CV by a recruiter, followed by an AI-powered screening conversation (10 min) with Emma, Mirakl&#39;s AI Talent Ambassador, to explore your background and motivation for the role. You will need to complete this step &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;within 3 days&lt;/span&gt;, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Interview&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;with our recruiter to discuss your profile and expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with your future manager —&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/pierre-lourdelet/&quot;&gt; Pierre Lourdelet&lt;/a&gt;, Data Scientist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with a future colleague, using structured STAR-method interviews to ensure transparency and fairness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome to Mirakl! 🎉&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is an internship position based in Paris, with up to two days of remote work permitted per month.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/mirakllabs/data-scientist-intern-paris-47383","tags":["Tech"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1791467709},{"slug":"enterprise-account-executive-paris-236331","company_name":"wizinc","title":"Enterprise Account Executive","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come join the organization that is redefining security for the AI era. As one of the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/100m-arr-in-18-months-wiz-becomes-the-fastest-growing-software-company-ever&quot;&gt; fastest-growing startups ever,&lt;/a&gt; we enable teams to secure cloud and AI applications by connecting code, cloud, and runtime into a single shared context. Trusted by security teams all over the world, we have a proven&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/products/wiz-wiz/reviews&quot;&gt; track record of success&lt;/a&gt; and a culture that values world-class talent. Not to mention, we&#39;re now&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/identity-security/google-completes-acquisition-of-wiz&quot;&gt; powered by Google&lt;/a&gt;, meaning we offer our customers an AI-powered platform that harnesses Google’s Threat Intelligence and Security Operations to better detect, prevent, and respond to threats across all environments, allowing for further innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;59&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;76&quot;&gt;Wiz is seeking an Enterprise Account Executive to drive the expansion of our cloud security market footprint. In this role, you will be responsible for developing, managing, and closing strategic business opportunities within the enterprise ecosystem. You will serve as a trusted advisor to C-level executives, particularly CISOs, translating technical value into clear business outcomes. Collaborating cross-functionally with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Product, and Marketing, you will build deep, lasting customer relationships while consistently meeting and exceeding growth objectives in alignment with core Wiz values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;717&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;736&quot;&gt;Demonstrate an intimate understanding of Wiz Cloud Security Solutions and their value to our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;841&quot;&gt;Position and advise to C-level level executives with industry Point-of-View business insights, listening to, building, and growing executive relationships with customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;Develop and close business to consistently meet or exceed quarterly sales quotas, in a way that reflects Wiz values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;Align with Wiz partner ecosystem to optimize market opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1194&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management with expert-level forecasting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Build effective working relationships with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Product, Marketing, Delivery, and Executive teams to ensure strategy alignment and achieve company objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;5 years of experience selling enterprise solutions in the cloud or cybersecurity space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;Proven track record of effective selling at the Enterprise level throughout the designated territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1679&quot;&gt;Experience managing accounts and driving growth in the cloud or cybersecurity ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1769&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional internal business units and their stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Established, positive relationships with previous sales operations teams and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Ability to employ a consultative, professional approach to customer engagements, with the agility to pivot dynamically in meetings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to build trust and advise C-level executives with industry-relevant point-of-view insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2229&quot;&gt;Passion for aligning with partner ecosystems to maximize market opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2229&quot;&gt;Proficiency in French, both written and spoken, is a bonus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where the position is based,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;without the need for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt; role does not offer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;visa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;sponsorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW149741735 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wiz is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Wiz will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wiz&#39;s Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/wizinc/enterprise-account-executive-paris-236331","tags":["Field Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1791467702},{"slug":"template-of-member-of-technical-staff-full-stack-paris-423144","company_name":"Remanence","title":"Template of Member of Technical Staff — Full-Stack","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Member of Technical Staff — Full-Stack</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remanence is pioneering the next era of enterprise AI by building intelligent systems that learn continuously from real-world execution. We transform complex enterprise workflows and business context into dynamic, interactive environments where AI agents can safely learn, adapt, and improve. By combining high-fidelity simulation environments with state-of-the-art training loops, we build specialized models that solve long-horizon, complex tasks with unmatched reliability. We're building the most talent-dense AI team in Europe to make this happen.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll build the product through which researchers and customers use Remanence: the web application, APIs, SDKs, and backend services connecting agent activity to evaluation and training. Your goal is to turn complex research capabilities into an intuitive platform that customers can use independently.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll work on</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build interfaces for exploring agent traces, creating environments and verifiers, launching training runs, and comparing evaluations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop APIs and SDKs that connect customers’ existing agents, tools, and data to Remanence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build backend workflows for sandboxed agent sessions, evaluations, and training jobs, with live progress, cancellation, retries, and clear failure handling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Implement platform foundations including authentication, permissions, customer isolation, and audit trails.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own features from prototype to production, working directly with researchers and customers to turn deployment feedback into reusable product capabilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own your services in production: testing, observability, performance and on-call.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Relevant technologies</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Backend:</strong> Python, Rust, FastAPI or Node.js, PostgreSQL, Redis, REST and gRPC.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Frontend:</strong> TypeScript, React, Next.js, and interfaces for streaming events and data visualization.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Platform:</strong> Docker, Kubernetes, Ray, and durable workflow orchestration such as Temporal.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus:</strong> Rust, Python/TypeScript SDK development, or experience building tools for agents and ML workflows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong production experience building backend systems in Python is mandatory.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About you</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're a strong backend engineer who is comfortable shipping a clean, useful interface. You care about API design, data modeling and correctness under concurrency and failure. You enjoy working closely with researchers and customers, and turning rough needs into tools people rely on.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We welcome both experienced specialists and generalists who learn exceptionally quickly. Experience deploying agents in production is nice to have. But prior ML experience is not required; evidence of shipping and owning production software matters.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What we offer</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive compensation and equity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A fast-paced environment combining frontier research with impactful real-world applications.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Visa sponsorship and relocation support for candidates joining us.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A flexible hybrid setup, with a preference for working together in person.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/remanence/template-of-member-of-technical-staff-full-stack-paris-423144","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1791466810},{"slug":"brand-lead-paris-416978","company_name":"Hcompany","title":"Brand lead","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About H:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">H exists to push the boundaries of superintelligence with agentic AI. By automating complex, multi-step tasks typically performed by humans, AI agents will help unlock full human potential.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>The Role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today, H is known for its story: its founders, its funding rounds, its press. We want it to be known for its value. Your mission is to make H one of the top 3 brands that large-enterprise decision-makers think of in enterprise AI, in France first, then in the US.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be our Brand lead, and the owner of the Brand pillar of our marketing strategy, alongside Growth and Product Marketing. You'll take over a brand foundation that is being shaped right now (positioning, identity, messaging house) and turn it into a brand that holds for the next five years in a market that reinvents itself every quarter.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our brand stance is that of a <strong>pragmatic visionary</strong>: bold on vision, precise and evidence-led on capability. You'll be the guardian of that balance, making sure every piece of work speaks the language of the boardroom and holds up to the scrutiny of a CTO/builder.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work hand in hand with leadership, Product, Research, Sales, our FDE teams and Communications, and with our external brand and PR agencies.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><h3>Lead the brand relaunch (Foundations)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take ownership of the new brand platform: positioning, identity, tone of voice and messaging house, and drive its rollout internally and externally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn our convictions into a story that is ours: what we believe, why we exist, what makes our approach to enterprise problems unique.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a brand system that flexes by market (France, UK, US) without losing coherence, and that separates our two registers: a bold "vision voice" and a precise "capability voice".</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set and enforce brand guidelines across every touchpoint: website, decks, events, product, recruiting.</p></li></ul><h3>Shift the narrative (Reputation)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Move the public conversation about H from founders and funding to product, value and customer outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make trust a brand signal: reliability, ownership, resilience and our research-first approach (we own our models, we are not a wrapper), carried through proof rather than claims.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Co-own reputation with Communications: Brand defines the positioning, Communications amplifies it through PR and executive voice.</p></li></ul><h3>Build awareness where our buyers are (Awareness)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design the brand plan that puts H in front of large-account decision-makers: flagship events, recurring PR moments, ecosystem programmes, content and campaigns.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare and lead the brand side of our US launch.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Growth so awareness turns into qualified relationships and pipeline.</p></li></ul><h3>Earn authority (Authority)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow H's thought leadership around the execution gap in enterprise AI and "AI that actually works".</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead strategic sponsorships and labels (e.g. Institut Polytechnique de Paris, our Resilient AI label) and partnerships with academics and consulting firms.</p></li></ul><h3>Build the function</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage brand budget and agencies (brand studio, freelancers).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hire and lead the Brand team as it grows, starting with a Content Manager.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How We'll Measure Success</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your north-star metric is the <strong>Brand Awareness Index (BAI)</strong>, measured on our target audiences only: decision-makers at large accounts (SBF 120 in France, Fortune 500 in the US), from business C-levels to "the builders" (CIOs, CTOs, architects, data and engineering leads).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The index combines aided awareness, unaided awareness and consideration of H in enterprise AI, tracked quarterly by market. Your first milestone is to set its baseline, since none exists today.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Horizon Target First 90 days BAI baseline set in France and the US; brand platform rolled out France Top 3 in aided awareness among SBF 120 decision-makers, then Top 3 in unaided awareness US Top 5 in aided awareness among Fortune 500 decision-makers, then Top 3 in unaided awareness within 2 years for AI for enterprise</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Supporting indicators: share of voice versus competitors, and the share of H mentions about product and value rather than founders and funding.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What We're Looking For</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">10+ years in brand, marketing or communications, including for a B2B tech company</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have led a brand repositioning or relaunch end to end, from strategy to rollout, and can show what it changed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have built awareness among enterprise decision-makers, and you have measured it (brand tracking, share of voice, consideration).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You understand deep tech well enough to translate it for a board without dumbing it down, and to defend it in front of engineers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are as comfortable with a CEO and a leadership team as with a brand studio or a PR agency, and you know how to brief, challenge and arbitrate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You think in systems and act in details: a clear strategy, a sharp eye for craft, and a bias for shipping.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent English is required; French is a strong plus.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>You Might Be a Great Fit If...</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have built a brand in an emerging category, where the words themselves were still being defined.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have worked across Europe and the US and know how a story needs to flex from one market to the other.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You care about proof: case studies, customer voices and numbers matter more to you than slogans.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are low ego and high ownership, and you like building a team and a function from the ground up.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Location</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Paris/London, hybrid: 3 days a week on average in our office (8 rue Sainte-Cécile, 75009) or with customers. Regular travel to London and the US.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What We Offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join the early days of one of Europe's most ambitious AI companies, and shape how the world sees it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real ownership: a seat at the table with leadership and a function to build.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A team of world-class researchers, engineers and operators who ship.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary and equity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Benefits: health insurance, meal vouchers, transport<br /><br /><strong>If you want to change the status quo in AI, join us.</strong></p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/hcompany/brand-lead-paris-416978","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Hybrid Paris","created_at":1791466808},{"slug":"infrastructure-engineer-platform-paris-93129","company_name":"Hcompany","title":"Infrastructure Engineer (Platform) - Paris","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll be joining the team responsible for the infrastructure behind all of H's products: clusters, networking and security. It's the foundation that lets the rest of the company deliver value directly to customers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What you'll own</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">From your first quarter, you'll own a real piece of our move from AWS to an environment-agnostic platform. The team moves fast and the problems are novel: each model release and each new customer changes what the infrastructure has to support.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What you'll be doing</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Running and scaling Kubernetes clusters and networking</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building authentication and authorization systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Refactoring the stack to be environment agnostic</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Speeding up deployment for our Forward Deployed Engineers (FDEs)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building Kubernetes-native services, such as controllers and operators</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Writing and maintaining infrastructure as code</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Your team and your users</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">The role sits in the Infrastructure team, with our VP of Engineering as hiring manager. Your users are H's product and platform engineers and, through our FDEs, our external customers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we think it takes</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You're likely a good fit if you:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Write Python or Go well enough to solve real problems with it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have built and operated a Kubernetes-based platform at significant scale and can put numbers on its clusters, services and users</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have worked with more than one cloud provider (AWS, Azure, GCP), or have strong knowledge of fundamental systems engineering (Linux, eBPF)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have built and owned infrastructure as code, CI/CD and observability</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Stronger still if you have:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Worked with complex network topologies (multi-cluster, dual-stack) and CNIs such as Cilium or Calico</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Handled petabyte-scale data, or high-frequency, latency-sensitive workloads</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Worked with agentic systems, particularly in security</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Worked with GPUs and tools such as Dynamo, vLLM or SGLang</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h2>How we hire</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Five stages, about 3.5 hours in all: a 30-minute call with our Talent team, a 30-minute conversation with the lead of the Infrastructure team, a 60-minute coding interview, a 60-minute system design interview and a closing 30-minute conversation with our VP of Engineering.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Practicalities</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">The role is hybrid, with three days a week in our Paris or London office. We offer a competitive package.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/hcompany/infrastructure-engineer-platform-paris-93129","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Hybrid Paris","created_at":1791466808},{"slug":"remote-enterprise-sales-lead-healthcare-270863","company_name":"ElevenLabs","title":"Enterprise Sales Lead - Healthcare","description":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $22B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role<br /></strong>In healthcare, the phone is still the front door, and call volume keeps rising while the people answering it are harder to hire and keep. You'll own our North America enterprise motion across providers, payers, and life sciences, helping health organizations put agents in front of patients, members, and clinicians that are safe, fast, and fit the systems they already run. You'll have the mandate to build the playbook and the team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>In this role, you will:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the enterprise healthcare function across health systems, payers, and pharma/medtech: strategy, pipeline, forecast, process, execution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define the enterprise ICP, sales methodology, and a repeatable motion for each segment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and lead a high-performing enterprise sales team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Land and expand with large health systems, health plans, and life sciences companies</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work through BAAs, security review, and AI governance boards (and MLR review for pharma), starting compliance conversations in week one</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with our Forward Deployed Engineers to scope integrations with the EHR, claims, and telephony systems customers already run</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help customers pick one high-volume starting point (scheduling, reminders, after-hours coverage, benefits and claims status, HCP support) and prove it before scaling</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a reference network of healthcare peers that buyers can call</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead executive briefings, events, and high-stakes negotiations</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring a sharp view of the competitive landscape, including build-vs-buy, platform bundlers, and vertical point solutions, to positioning and strategy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set the bar for sales culture, integrity, and customer-first execution</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Requirements:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven enterprise sales leadership in a high-growth, product-led tech company (AI/ML strongly preferred)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track record selling to health systems, payers, or life sciences, with fluency in HIPAA, BAAs, and long, multi-stakeholder cycles</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building and scaling sales teams from the ground up</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Seven-figure enterprise deals and complex sales cycles</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to be strategic and hands-on at once</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Executive presence at C-suite and board levels</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborative, humble, and driven</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passion for the transformative potential of conversational AI</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Remote-first in the United States, with a strong preference for New York or San Francisco, where we have office spaces.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/elevenlabs/remote-enterprise-sales-lead-healthcare-270863","tags":["Revenue"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1791492012},{"slug":"remote-direct-tax-lead-263237","company_name":"ElevenLabs","title":"Direct Tax Lead","description":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $22B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reli