 and production teams supporting PR, film, and creative execution. As Impact's first dedicated producer, you'll build the production and launch engine for a team whose external footprint is scaling fast, this quarter alone includes 5+ events, six documentaries in production, two live ElevenLabs Summit sessions, a partner launch every month, and several more case studies in flight.<br /></p><h2><strong>What you'll do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate production of Impact's documentary case studies: travel and work onsite for filming when needed, work closely with external production and direction teams, bringing opinions on story and craft, and partner with our Design team to make sure every film meets ElevenLabs' bar and brand guidelines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and execute Impact's conferences and activations alongside the Events team, turning each one into an in-person moment that drives real ROI and leaves a lasting impression, with Impact's own storytelling angle built in.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support Comms in telling Impact's story through PR, coordinating with Comms and, when applicable, a PR agency to keep press windows and partner announcements on track, and helping make sure Impact's international stories get told well as the program expands globally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Design to keep all video and static collateral on-brand, advocating for a high creative standard and Impact’s lens.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Carry a consistent visual and narrative thread across launches, blog content, and ElevenLabs Summit presentations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Draft copy for social and blog content, collaborating with Comms to land a final draft, and with Design on all launch-related visual assets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage multiple concurrent launches, shoots, and events at once.<br /></p></li></ul