/span></p></li></ul> <br> <h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you'll do:</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Be the main point of contact for your clients and build long-term relationships - you think about their business, not just their campaigns.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Implement growth strategies across SEO/GEO, paid ads, email, social and more, using AI with the team.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Coordinate specialists to deliver great work on time and on budget, with high standards and honest feedback.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Run data and AI-assisted analyses to find growth opportunities and turn them into business cases and new projects.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Keep an eye on budgets and billing, with support from our finance team.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Optional: lead the specialist team, including team happiness and recruiting.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">Key &amp; Essential Skills:</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ideally 7+ years in a performance agency (not media buying), including 3+ years leading a team of 3+.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Deep knowledge of at least 3 marketing channels (e.g. SEO, Google Ads, Meta, content), with CHF 1M+ in total managed budget.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Proven record in client strategy, sales and building data-driven business cases that clients invest in.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Native-level German, understanding of Swiss German, fluent English.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Comfortable using AI as a core tool for analysis, reporting and consulting.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">What makes you a fit:</span></strong></h4><u