</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build the processes the CTO office and engineering team need to scale</p></li></ul></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We're Looking For</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Studies (preferably Master level) or a degree in computer science or a related technical field, <strong>OR</strong> in business, economics or management with a strong understanding of technology</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Very good commercial understanding: you think in business impact, not just technology</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real curiosity for tech: you can follow and discuss AI and infrastructure topics with engineers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">First practical experience in a fast-paced environment such as a startup, consulting or VC</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builder's mindset:</strong> you take high ownership and enjoy building processes from scratch</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hustle &amp; execution:</strong> you're pragmatic and move fast without losing sight of quality – a "get shit done" mentality is essential</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Organizational talent:</strong> you stay calm under pressure and work in a highly structured and precise way</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Communication:</strong> excellent written and verbal English, German is a plus</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus Points</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to AI, cloud or GPU infrastructure</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've built something yourself: a side project, student initiative or venture</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Why us?</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Outstanding team: Work with some of the best engineers in the world, coming from hedge funds, big tech, AI startups and top univ