p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Be part of something bigger.</strong> Join a global community of linguists, subject matter experts, and language professionals advancing human knowledge together.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Grow without limits.</strong> Access diverse, innovative projects that expand your portfolio and sharpen your skills across industries and domains.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Have fun doing what you love.</strong> Bring your language skills to life on projects that are as interesting as they are impactful.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What to Consider Before Applying</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Not ideal as a full-time job or primary income source.</strong> Work availability fluctuates with project demand; as a 1099 contractor, you won't receive benefits such as health insurance, paid time off, or retirement contributions, and hours are not guaranteed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Requires reliable availability and commitment.</strong> Most tasks require a minimum of 2 hours per day or 10 hours per week.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Geographic restrictions may apply.</strong> We cannot engage contractors in regions subject to international embargo or sanctions. As a 1099 contractor, you are solely responsible for your own tax obligations.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How to Join Our Expert Community</strong></p><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Submit your application, including an updated copy of your CV in English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">If a test is required, you will be asked to take a test in the domain(s) you specialize in.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Once selected and you've passed the test, we'll guide you through onboarding — completing an application form, getting you set up for payments, and welcoming you into our community.</p></li></ol><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI is changing how the world communicates — and LILT is leading that transformation.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">LILT's mission is to make the world's information available to everyone, no matter the language they speak. Join our global community who thrive on innovation and excellence. Our collective knowledge, uniqueness, and skills deliver multilingual AI and human-verified services to Enterprises, Governments, and AI Developers around the world.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Earn money. Have fun. Advance human knowledge. Work on diverse projects from anywhere, any time you want. Get paid quickly and fairly, and build your professional network in a supportive community—all through a streamlined application process tailored to your expertise.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Information collected and processed as part of your application process, including any job applications you choose to submit, is subject to LILT's Privacy Policy at </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://lilt.com/legal/privacy"><em><u>https://lilt.com/legal/privacy</u></em></a><em>.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>At LILT, we are committed to a fair, inclusive, and transparent hiring process. As part of our recruitment efforts, we may use artificial intelligence (AI) and automated tools to assist in the evaluation of applications, including résumé screening, assessment scoring, and interview analysis. These tools are designed to support human decision-making and help us identify qualified candidates efficiently and objectively. All final hiring decisions are made by people. If you have any concerns, require accommodations, or would like to opt-out of the use of AI in our hiring process, please let us know at ----- style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>LILT is an equal opportunity employer. We extend equal opportunity to all individuals without regard to an individual’s race, religion, color, national origin, ancestry, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic characteristics, veteran or marital status, pregnancy, or any other classification protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. We are committed to the principles of fair employment and the elimination of all discriminatory practices.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/lilt-production/linguist-somali-ui-technical-marketing-remote-60289","tags":["LiltLancer Community"],"job_types":["Contract"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1791340803},{"slug":"senior-enterprise-account-executive-100246","company_name":"conga","title":"Senior Enterprise Account Executive","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;A career that’s the whole package!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Conga, we’ve built a community where our colleagues can thrive. Here you’ll find opportunities to innovate and support growth through individual and team development, all within an environment where every voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&lt;/strong&gt; lines up commercial operations so companies run as connected, smarter businesses. By unifying the people and processes that drive commerce, Conga aligns pricing, quoting, contracting, rebates, and communications so teams stay in sync and buyers keep moving forward. The result is trusted decisions, consistent buyer experiences, and profitable growth. More than 10,000 customers worldwide, including over 50% of the Fortune 100®, trust Conga when commercial complexity is high and global impact is on the line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Switzerland (remote)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;RVP Sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel: &lt;/strong&gt;within DACH&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;native/C2 level French and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Quick Snapshot…..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you&#39;ll be at the forefront of our revenue growth strategy, driving both new business acquisition and the expansion of existing enterprise accounts across key strategic industries in the DACH region. You will build trusted relationships with executive stakeholders, understand complex business challenges, and position Conga&#39;s enterprise-wide solutions to deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Sales Engineering, Business Development, Marketing, Transformation Specialists, Customer Success, Professional Services, Partners, and clients, you will manage the full sales lifecycle from prospecting through close. This role is focused on 40% new business generation and 60% growth within existing customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why it&#39;s a big deal…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the opportunity to sell high-impact, mission-critical transformation initiatives that create substantial value for enterprise organizations. You will develop and execute territory, account, and opportunity plans, engage senior decision-makers, and lead complex sales cycles to drive predictable revenue growth within your assigned region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the person we are looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have at least 20 years of successful B2B enterprise technology sales experience within the SaaS industry and a strong track record of success in DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a trusted advisor to enterprise customers, aligning business challenges with measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceeds quota within complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise sales environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds and leverages executive, customer, partner, and ecosystem relationships to create, accelerate, and expand strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong knowledge of AI, automation, and revenue management trends, effectively translating these into customer value and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives predictable revenue growth through strategic account planning, executive engagement, and value-based selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter Mentality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a passion for identifying, pursuing, and winning new business opportunities. Through persistence, strategic thinking, and strong commercial acumen, you consistently create pipeline and close high-value enterprise deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Selling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take a consultative approach to understanding customer challenges, business priorities, and strategic objectives. You effectively position Conga&#39;s solutions and services, clearly articulating value and demonstrating how they help customers achieve their desired outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You proactively leverage available resources and take ownership of results. You are highly motivated, resilient, and committed to achieving success regardless of the challenges encountered along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can articulate complex technology concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences. You possess excellent listening, presentation, and negotiation skills, enabling you to address objections, build credibility, and influence stakeholders at every level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You embrace change and continuously adapt to evolving market conditions, customer priorities, and competitive dynamics. You are innovative in your approach and seek new ways to create value for customers and the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work effectively across cross-functional teams including Sales Engineering, Business Development, Marketing, Customer Success, Professional Services, and Partners to deliver exceptional customer outcomes. You have the leadership presence and influence to align stakeholders, mobilize resources, and drive successful business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will give you an edge...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling Revenue Lifecycle Management solutions with strong knowledge of CPQ, CLM, revenue optimization, document generation, and e-signature products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education and/or experience in Economics, Statistics, Mathematics, Accounting, Marketing, Finance, or Operations Research is considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Did we pique your interest? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of job you would love in the kind of environment where you would thrive, please click apply. &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Resume Format&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We accept resumes in any format, we suggest using PDF or plain text. These formats help ensure that your resume’s formatting remains intact, making it easier for our recruiters to review your application promptly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t meet every requirement for the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and members of ethnic minorities are less likely to apply to jobs unless they meet every single qualification. At Conga we are dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace, so if you’re excited about this role but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyway. You just might be the right candidate for this or other roles. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;st-additionalInformation&quot; class=&quot;job-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conga is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer and provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity, age, national origin, disability, parental or pregnancy status, marriage and civil partnership, sexual orientation, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. We understand interviewing can be stressful for those with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation is needed to allow you to show us your best self, please let your recruiter know as soon as possible. All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines. Conga is not open to third party solicitation or resumes for our posted FTE positions. Resumes received from third party agencies that are unsolicited will be considered complimentary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;job-apply print-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&#39;s Applicant Privacy Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The information you provide during the application process will be used in accordance with Conga’s Applicant Privacy Statement (&lt;a href=&quot;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&quot;&gt;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&lt;/a&gt;). By submitting your application, you acknowledge and agree to the terms outlined in this privacy statement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/conga/senior-enterprise-account-executive-100246","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1791330913},{"slug":"research-engineer-zurich-413492","company_name":"Sereact GmbH","title":"Research Engineer (m/f/d)","description":"<h1>Research Engineer, Manipulation Data &amp; Teleoperation — Zurich</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role owns the data generation layer of Sereact's VLA stack: teleoperation systems and data collection infrastructure that feed Cortex, built from our Zurich research hub.</p><h2>About Sereact</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sereact is a Series B embodied-AI company. Cortex, our VLA model, is deployed in live warehouse robotic cells across the EU and US. Zurich is our newest research hub, focused on the manipulation and control problems that sit underneath Cortex.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>The role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a Research Engineer position. It is scoped to the data generation layer of the VLA stack: teleoperation hardware and software, retargeting pipelines that map human demonstrations onto robot hands, and the data collection infrastructure that feeds Cortex. It requires building the systems that produce the data those models train on, and working closely with the training team on what that data needs to look like.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What you'll do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and operate teleoperation systems for dexterous manipulation, including retargeting algorithms that map human hand and arm motion onto robot end-effectors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and maintain scalable, UMI-style data collection hardware and software that other engineers at Sereact rely on</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Benchmark control and retargeting approaches using rigorous, human-factors-informed methodology</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Instrument and support the physical robots deployed in the Zurich hub, including day-to-day work on the control stack</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the model-training team to define what data they need and close the loop on data quality</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build tooling or infrastructure outside your immediate brief when it unblocks the wider team</p></li></ul><h2>What you'll bring</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">MSc (or equivalent, in progress) in robotics, mechanical engineering, or a closely related field, with a thesis or capstone project on manipulation, teleoperation, or retargeting</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience building a data collection device or system for robot learning (UMI or a comparable system), not just operating one someone else built</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working knowledge of retargeting algorithms for mapping human input onto robot hands or end-effectors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">1 to 2 years of combined research, internship, or industry experience in robotics, mechatronics, or a related engineering discipline</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Software and systems engineering skills strong enough to build and maintain infrastructure other engineers rely on, not only research-grade prototypes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working as an individual contributor in a small, still-forming team</p></li></ul><h2>Nice to have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A conference submission on manipulation, teleoperation, or retargeting where the candidate is an author (an MSc thesis submitted to a venue like CoRL counts; supervising a student team whose own work was later published does not)</p></li><li><p sty